  "body": "## Improvements\r\n\r\n### Pickers and Navigation\r\n\r\n- **Safer file and photo pickers:** If the system picker cannot be opened, Echo Music now shows a short message instead of closing unexpectedly. This applies to Storage Settings, Backup and Restore, Font Selection, Equalizer, and Playlist screens.\r\n- **More reliable playlist routing:** Playlist IDs are now validated and decoded before opening, so online and library playlists go to the right screen.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Fixed crashes caused by system pickers failing to launch (`ActivityNotFoundException` and `SecurityException`).\r\n- Fixed a crash in version 1.4.2 where Quick Picks and Forgotten Favourites could fail with `NoSuchElementException`.\r\n- Fixed incorrect handling of malformed or encoded playlist IDs during navigation.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Internal\r\n\r\n- Added `ActivityResultLauncherExt.launchSafely` to wrap picker launches and handle errors in one place.\r\n- Added `PlaylistNavigation` helpers to validate, decode, and route playlist IDs.\r\n- Replaced SQLite `RANDOM()` ordering in `DatabaseDao.quickPicks` and `forgottenFavorites` with a per-invocation random seed, including the Quick Picks fallback seeds. Room re-reads parent statements while loading relations, and changing IDs between passes caused the crash. Results stay varied between refreshes, and no database migration is needed.\r\n- Added Robolectric unit tests for picker error handling and playlist navigation routing.\r\n- Added four Room regression tests covering more than 100 candidates, artistless songs, hidden-song filtering, fallback selection without playback history, and variation across seeds.\r\n- Documented the query safety rule in `AGENT.md` and recorded the fix in `upcomingupdate.json`.\r\n- Validation: all 12 core unit tests passed, and `:app:compileUniversalGmsDebugKotlin` compiled successfully.",
